:: Asylum Depths Investigate
<<effects>>

You investigate the staircase. The first flight feels solid beneath your feet, but around the corner the upper section has collapsed. You can see another floor above, though there's no safe way to reach it from here.
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to the corridor|Asylum Depths]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Explore
<<effects>>

<<if !$asylum_mirror>>
	You explore one of the decrepit rooms. It's empty, save for an object in the far corner. It's the same height as you, and covered in a sheet.
	<br><br>

	<<if !pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
		<<link [[Remove the sheet|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Return to the hallways|Asylum Depths]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$asylum_office>>
	<<set $asylum_office to 1>>
	You find an office door, hanging askew on one hinge. You step through.
	<br><br>
	The interior is in worse shape than the other rooms. Furniture leans against other furniture, with piles of old notes wedged between them. You can barely see the back of the room.
	<br><br>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
		<span class="blue">You can't clear the office with your arms bound.</span>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Try to clear some space (0:20)|Asylum Depths Office 1 Clear]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><<housekeepingdifficulty 1 100>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Return to the hallways|Asylum Depths]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$asylum_garden>>
	You smell fresh air up ahead. You turn a corner, and see a door stood open, leading outside.
	<br><br>
	You walk into an overgrown garden, tangled by thorns. You see the asylum fence above and beyond it, some distance away, and hear running water.
	<br><br>

	You find a set of garden tools just inside the asylum proper, including shears and secateurs.
	<br><br>

	<<if pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
		<span class="blue">You can't trim the tangle with your arms bound.</span>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Trim the tangle (0:20)|Asylum Depths Garden 1 Trim]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 100>>
	<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Return to the hallways|Asylum Depths]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror Intro
<<effects>>

<<set $asylum_mirror_small_carried to 0>>
<<set $asylum_mirror_medium_carried to 0>>
<<set $asylum_mirror_large_carried to 0>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>

You pull away the sheet. A tall mirror stands beneath it, with metal decoration around the frame. Unlike the rest of the room, the glass is clean. You see your reflection, <span class="blue">then notice someone behind you.</span> A <<person>> sits there, watching you through the mirror.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

You whirl on the spot, but there's no one there. You turn back to the mirror. The <<person>> still watches you, as if expecting something. You now see that the room in the mirror is different from the room in which you stand. It's larger, and richly decorated, if old-fashioned.
<br><br>

<<if !pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
	<<link [[Wave at the <<person>>|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Wave]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Talk to the <<person>>|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Talk]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Dance|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Dance]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the room|Asylum Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Return
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
You return to the room with the tall mirror. It's as you left it. You look in the mirror, and see a <<person>> on the other side, watching you.
<br><br>

<<if !pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
	<<link [[Wave at the <<person>>|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Wave]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Talk to the <<person>>|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Talk]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Dance|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Dance]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the room|Asylum Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Wave
<<effects>>

You raise a hand and wave. The <<person>> watches the movement without copying it, so you lower your hand again.
<br><br>

<<link [[Talk to the <<person>>|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Talk]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Dance|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Dance]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the room|Asylum Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Talk
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Hello," you say. "Can I help you?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You glance down before looking back at the <<person>>. "Um, hello," you say. "Can I help you?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Hello," you say, keeping your hands by your sides. "Do you need something?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"Hello," you say. "Is there something I can help you with?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You give the <<person>> a small wave. "Hello there. Have I got your attention?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Hey," you say. "Is there a fly on my nose or something?"
<<else>>
	"Hello," you say. "Who are you?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

You wait for an answer. The <<person>> stays silent and keeps watching you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Wave at the <<person>>|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Wave]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Dance|Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Dance]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the room|Asylum Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Asylum Depths Mirror Intro Dance
<<effects>>

You start dancing, keeping the movements simple and following your own rhythm. <span class="lblue">The <<person>> leans forward</span> as soon as you begin, reaching for something outside the mirror's view. You hear a click, followed by static, then chirpy music starts playing. <<He>> settles back without taking <<his>> eyes off you.
<br><br>

<<set $asylum_mirror_small to 0>>
<<set $asylum_mirror_medium to 0>>
<<set $asylum_mirror_large to 1>>

<<if $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max>>
	<span class="blue">You're too tired to dance right now.</span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Keep dancing (0:20)|Asylum Depths Mirror Dance]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 20>><<tiredness 6>><<danceskill 1>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gdanceskill>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave|Asylum Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror
<<effects>>
<<asylum_mirror_assess>>

You enter the mirror room.
<<generate1>><<person1>>

<<if _asylum_mirror_count gte 18>>
	They reveal a richly decorated auditorium, the seats full, and all faces watching you in expectation. 
<<elseif _asylum_mirror_count gte 15>>
	They reveal a considerable audience, all faces watching you in expectation. Smoke from lit cigarettes forms a cloud above them.
<<elseif _asylum_mirror_count gte 12>>
	They reveal a large audience, some sat in seats facing you, others at small tables.
<<elseif _asylum_mirror_count gte 9>>
	They reveal an audience sat on velvet seats, all watching you.
<<elseif _asylum_mirror_count gte 6>>
	They reveal a small audience, crowded and eager.
<<else>>
	<<if $asylum_mirror_medium is 0 and $asylum_mirror_small is 0 and $asylum_mirror_large is 1>>
		A <<person>> waits for you through the glass, watching for you to begin.
	<<elseif $asylum_mirror_medium is 1 and $asylum_mirror_small is 0 and $asylum_mirror_large is 1>>
		A <<person>> waits for you through the large mirror. A <<generate2>><<generate3>><<person2>><<person>> and <<person3>><<person>> squeeze into view behind a smaller frame, watching for you to begin.
	<<elseif $asylum_mirror_medium is 0 and $asylum_mirror_small is 1 and $asylum_mirror_large is 1>>
		A <<person>> waits for you through the large mirror, while a <<generate2>><<person2>><<person>> peers through the small one beside it.
	<<else>>
		A <<person>> waits behind the mirror with several others gathered around <<him>>. They all turn their attention to you.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<asylum_depths_mirror_links>>

<<if $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max>>
	<span class="blue">You're too tired to dance right now.</span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Dance (0:20)|Asylum Depths Mirror Dance]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 20>><<tiredness 6>><<danceskill 1>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gdanceskill>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave|Asylum Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror Small
<<effects>>
<<asylum_mirror_assess>>
<<generate4>><<person4>>
You place a small mirror on a dusty surface. The moment you do, a <<person>>'s face appears on the other side.
<<if _rng gte 81>>
	<<He>> shifts around, as if trying to get comfortable.
<<elseif _rng gte 61>>
	<<He>> watches you, an eager grin on <<his>> face.
<<elseif _rng gte 41>>
	<<He>> gives you an encouraging smile.
<<elseif _rng gte 21>>
	<<He>> furrows <<his>> brow.
<<else>>
	<<He>> strokes <<his>> chin.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $asylum_mirror is 2 and _asylum_mirror_count gte 6>>
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 2]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylum_mirror is 3 and _asylum_mirror_count gte 12>>
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 3]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylum_mirror is 4 and _asylum_mirror_count gte 18>>
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4]]>><<set $asylum_mirror to 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<asylum_depths_mirror_links>>

	<<if $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max>>
		<span class="blue">You're too tired to dance right now.</span>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Dance (0:20)|Asylum Depths Mirror Dance]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 20>><<tiredness 6>><<danceskill 1>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gdanceskill>>
