:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4
<<effects>>

The lights flicker, then die, plunging you into darkness.
<br><br>

"Sorry for the interruption, folks," says a voice. "We'll have the lights on in a jiffy." A few seconds later, the lights return. You're standing behind the stage, peeking out from behind the curtain.
<br><br>

"You're ready for this," the <<person1>><<person>> says, resting a hand on your shoulder. "I know you won't disappoint."
<br><br>


<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 2
<<effects>>

The <<person>> steps by you, out onto the stage. "Ladies and gentlemen," <<he>> says. "It's time for the main event. You probably know <<phim>> as <<overworld_nickname>>. The more daring of you might know <<phim>> as <<underworld_nickname>>. Regardless, please join me in a round of applause for the greatest sensation this town has ever produced."
<br><br>

The <<person>> bows and steps aside as you walk onto the stage. The applause is deafening.
<br><br>

<<link [[Tell a joke|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Joke]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Dance|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[This isn't real|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Joke
<<effects>>

You wait for a gap in the applause, then tell a joke. A few people laugh first, followed by the rest of the audience until the room fills with it.
<br><br>

<<link [[Dance|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[This isn't real|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower]]>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000>>
<br>


:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower
<<effects>>

You look past the stage lights and remember the dusty room around you. You're standing in front of an array of mirrors.
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	Strange as they may be, you're in the asylum, and it could be dangerous to forget. Just like that, <span class="green">you're back in the mirror room,</span> but the scene still plays out in front of you, the audience awaiting.
	<br><br>

	Then you notice dark gaps between members of the audience. Something seems to be watching through them. You focus on the gaps, trying to make out a shape. A rush of unfamiliar emotion hits you, first curiosity, then panic.
	<br><br>

	You black out.
	<br><br>
	
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	The stage takes over your attention again. <span class="red">Your feet begin tapping to the music</span> before you can stop them.<<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance
<<effects>>

Music starts as the lights shift, leaving the audience in darkness while the stage stays bright. A dim orchestra is visible to one side. You keep dancing under the audience's attention, picking up speed as the music pushes you on despite your growing fatigue.<<lllawareness>><<llltrauma>><<awareness -18>><<trauma -18>>
<br><br>

You push yourself faster until your legs give way, sending you down onto the stage.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3
<<effects>>


<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
You awaken on your bed, in your cell. Doctor Harper stands over you, a concerned frown on <<his>> face.
<br><br>

"I'm glad you're well," <<he>> says. "We found you in the forbidden section, surrounded by mirrors. How do you feel?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Say you're fine|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Fine]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> <<he>> must take you to your audience at once|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Audience]]>><<awareness -6>><<trauma -6>><</link>><<lawareness>><<ltrauma>>
