<<link [[Remain Silent|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Fine
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I'm well," you say. "Sorry for concerning you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You look down at the blanket. "I'm okay," you say. "Sorry if I worried you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm fine," you say, settling back against the bed. "You don't need to stay."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"I'm all right, thank you," you say. "Sorry for the trouble."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You raise a hand from the bed. "Still alive," you say. "No need to fuss."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm fine," you say. "Mind your own business."
<<else>>
	"I'm okay," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Harper gives you a small smile, though <<his>> brow stays furrowed. "As you say. I'll leave you to your peace. Be well." <<He>> leaves your cell and closes the door behind <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<earnFeat "Mirror Madness">>
<span class="gold">You've unlocked the Mirror Madness trait</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Asylum Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Audience
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	You bolt upright. "My audience!" you say. "They must be waiting for me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You sit straighter. "My audience is waiting," you say. "Could you take me to them, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You fold your hands in your lap. "I need to see my audience," you say. "Please take me to them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"My audience is waiting for me," you say. "Would you take me to them, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You sit up and spread your arms. "At last. Take me to my audience. I can't keep them waiting."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Bring me to my audience," you say. "And a glass of water. I'll need it if I'm to stay upright."
<<else>>
	"My audience is waiting for me," you say. "Aside from that, I'm fine."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Harper's brow furrows. <<He>> gives you a careful smile. "We'll talk about that later," <<he>> says. "If you like. For now I'll leave you to your peace. Be well." <<He>> leaves your cell and closes the door behind <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<earnFeat "Mirror Madness">>
<span class="gold">You've unlocked the Mirror Madness trait</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Asylum Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

