:: Asylum Depths Office 1 Clear
<<effects>>

You examine the furniture, not wanting to disturb the chaos without knowing how everything is supported.
<br><br>
<<if $housekeepingSuccess>>
	<<set $asylum_office to 2>>
	<<set $asylum_mirror_small_carried += 1>>
	A pile of notes near the door looks safe to move. Most of it is inventory paperwork. You lift the papers away in batches, <span class="green">clearing a path into the office proper.</span>
	<br><br>

	It looks like it used to be a private office, though other furniture has since been dumped here. A reflection catches your eye from beneath a sheet. <span class="gold">A small mirror is tucked underneath it.</span> You pull it free. 
	<<if $asylum_mirror gte 2>>
		Perhaps it would be happier in the mirror room.<<lawareness>><<ltrauma>><<awareness -6>><<trauma -6>>
	<<else>>
		Perhaps it will be useful later.<<lawareness>><<ltrauma>><<awareness -6>><<trauma -6>>
	<</if>>
