<<effects>>

Several desks are crammed together, taking up most of the room.
<<if $housekeepingSuccess>>
	<<set $asylum_office to 4>>
	<<set $asylum_mirror_large_carried += 1>>
	They're heavy, but you notice they're built from several components, attached with a simple mechanism. You take them apart, and carry the pieces to other rooms, <span class="green">clearing the space.</span>
	<br><br>
	One desk is different. Larger. It looks like an antique. A large mirror lies flat on its top.
	<<if $asylum_mirror gte 2>>
