:: Asylum Depths Office 4 Clear
<<effects>>

Paperwork litters the floor, so thick and uneven you almost trip, and all of it coated in dust.
<<if $housekeepingSuccess>>
	<<set $asylum_office to 5>>
	You start sorting the paperwork into the filing cabinets around the room. Inventory manifests go into one cabinet, patient records into another. Once the larger piles are separated, <span class="green">the rest goes quickly.</span>
	<br><br>
	With the office clean, you sit at the main desk and lean back to look over your work. A knock at the door makes you sit up.
	<br><br>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	"Excuse me," says a <<personsimple>>'s voice. A <<person>> steps in, and looks around. "I had family here, and they won't let me access the records. Can I look around?"<<gggcool>><<asylumstatus 9>>
